          "filename": "Hugh Trenchard memorial in Salisbury Cathedral.jpg",
          "caption": "Memorial to Hugh Trenchard, first son of Hugh Trenchard, 1st Viscount Trenchard, in Salisbury Cathedral.  The memorial shows the text:\nLt the Hon HUGH TRENCHARD\nGrenadier Guards: Born 6 6 1920\nKilled in N Africa 17 3 1943\nEldest son of Marshal of the RAF\nViscount Trenchard\n'His lot was with the dawn of life to die\nIn battle : at the dawn of victory.'",
